            <ArticleTitle>Genital pain associated with genital retraction: a case of Koro syndrome.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>176-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Koro is a unique psychiatric disorder in which acute anxiety accompanies the perception of genital retraction. This case report describes a case of Koro syndrome associated with penile and scrotal pain. A review of the literature has not shown any previous report of Koro associated with genital pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
